00:44:40,080 --> 00:44:40,640
Yeah, totally.

478
00:44:40,960 --> 00:44:49,920
I mean, look, hopefully you're using, either you feel very confident in your own method of doing this or using a well tested tool to do this, right?

479
00:44:50,080 --> 00:44:54,480
Like this is the type of thing that like at Teltek, we're not going to try to build that ourselves, right?

