00:45:12,640 --> 00:45:16,160
Because, like, fifty percent of our user base having a terrible experience is really expensive.

486
00:45:16,240 --> 00:45:16,320
Right.

487
00:45:16,800 --> 00:45:24,160
So that's a situation where you might say, all right, if this risky test is still worth running, let's expose the test to ten percent of our customers.

