00:45:27,280 --> 00:45:40,000
But then afterwards, yeah, exactly, to your point, you have to go and make sure that ninety percent of your customers are getting the intended experience, five percent are in your control group and five percent are in your variant group, because if that's not the case, throw your analysis away, right?

